{"title":"라그나 크림슨 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dw35w/dJMcaivThiW/Y9ePmawOgilyqUzx8BLN51&filename=th3","synopsis":"은검을 휘두르며 용을 사냥해 보수를 받는 직업―― ‘수룡인(狩龍人)’.\n풋내기 수룡인 소년 라그나는 독보적으로 용 토벌 전적을 자랑하는 천재소녀 레오니카와 콤비를 짜고 용 토벌에 도전하는 나날을 보내고 있었다.\n라그나의 바람은 단 한 가지―― “강해지지 않아도 좋으니, 레오의 곁에 언제까지나 있었으면.”\n소년의 소망은 최강 악룡의 강습으로 인해 산산이 부서지고….\n노려라, 절대강자. 저항하라, 강제운명. 한계의 저편까지――.\n금욕의 끝을 달리는 이세계 극한배틀!!\n\nⓒDaiki Kobayashi/SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":255,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":91,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":192,"change":{"type":"down","amount":101}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":57}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":159,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":232,"change":{"type":"down","amount":73}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":233,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":232,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":225,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":140,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":140,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-10-07","rank":150,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":148,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":149,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":136}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":286,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":285,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"